WEBVTT

00:16.960 --> 00:20.880
BANGKWAI WITTHAYAKHOM'S 100-YEAR BUILDING

00:20.960 --> 00:23.000
-Come on.
-Go on.

00:27.600 --> 00:28.800
Hey, No.

00:28.880 --> 00:29.760
Don't do it.

00:32.800 --> 00:34.120
Hey, No.

00:34.760 --> 00:36.760
There is a certain kind of madman

00:38.360 --> 00:40.520
who happens to gain power.

00:41.760 --> 00:44.320
They always try to cover up
their own wrongdoings

00:46.640 --> 00:49.040
with other people’s scandals.

00:50.640 --> 00:51.920
But…

00:52.000 --> 00:53.880
when an elephant dies,

00:53.960 --> 00:56.360
can you really cover the whole thing
with a lotus leaf?

02:03.480 --> 02:06.480
BANGKWAI WITTHAYAKHOM'S 100-YEAR BUILDING

02:06.560 --> 02:07.600
THIS AREA IS UNDER RENOVATION.

02:07.680 --> 02:09.400
IN 25 DAYS, BANGKWAI WITTHAYAKHOM'S
100-YEAR BUILDING WILL OPEN

02:43.280 --> 02:44.120
WILL THE 100-YEAR BUILDING
REALLY BE ABLE TO OPEN FOR USE?

02:44.200 --> 02:46.880
Bangkwai Witthayakhom's 100-Year Building

02:46.960 --> 02:48.800
has officially been handed over
following renovations.

02:49.400 --> 02:51.120
But can it really be used?

02:51.200 --> 02:53.160
The load-bearing columns
have major cracks in them.

02:53.760 --> 02:54.800
The cement is below spec.

02:54.880 --> 02:56.480
The steel doesn't meet standards.

02:56.560 --> 02:59.120
This reeks of corruption.

03:00.840 --> 03:03.520
Did you see what the Exclamation group
exposed about the 100-Year Building?

03:03.600 --> 03:06.920
-How much do you think they embezzled?
-The photo is obviously the headmaster.

03:07.000 --> 03:09.400
She's wearing red all over.
There's only one person like that.

03:09.480 --> 03:12.200
-They're still going to open the building?
-That's scary.

03:13.000 --> 03:15.120
Who would dare use the building?

03:15.200 --> 03:16.640
Something's definitely going on.

03:16.720 --> 03:18.960
Look at that.
Did they repair it, or just tear it down?

03:19.040 --> 03:21.800
Yeah, what kind of cement is that?
Why did it crack so easily?

03:21.880 --> 03:23.960
Look at that. The steel must be fake.

03:24.040 --> 03:26.040
What about the other buildings?

03:28.520 --> 03:29.560
Where are you?

03:29.640 --> 03:30.640
I see Tae.

03:34.280 --> 03:35.520
STORAGE ROOM
NO ENTRY

03:35.600 --> 03:37.720
Everyone, the president's going inside.

03:46.080 --> 03:47.480
EURO PANG

03:49.720 --> 03:50.720
Who called this meeting in this spot?

03:51.320 --> 03:53.280
Why aren't we using
the rooftop of Building 6 like before?

03:53.800 --> 03:56.080
Weren't you the one
who typed that in the group?

03:57.240 --> 03:59.120
I'm not that out of it, Wanda.

04:07.080 --> 04:08.440
You're definitely out of it.

04:08.520 --> 04:09.480
SEE YOU TOMORROW MORNING
AT THE STORAGE ROOM UNDER BUILDING 2

04:11.560 --> 04:12.840
Hey…

04:12.920 --> 04:13.840
That wasn't me.

04:15.080 --> 04:16.399
Are you teasing me?

04:17.600 --> 04:18.800
I'll show you.

04:20.240 --> 04:21.399
SEE YOU TOMORROW MORNING
AT THE STORAGE ROOM UNDER BUILDING 2

04:22.600 --> 04:24.680
Look. It wasn't me.

04:25.800 --> 04:26.880
You're joking, right?

04:27.480 --> 04:28.520
Beng, was it you?

04:28.600 --> 04:29.680
Not me.

04:30.800 --> 04:32.600
-Shit.
-What?

04:32.680 --> 04:34.920
Someone else is in our chat room. Look.

04:36.440 --> 04:37.440
Oops. I got caught.

04:37.520 --> 04:38.360
Hey.

04:38.440 --> 04:39.400
Whose voice was that?

04:55.400 --> 04:56.520
Hi.

04:57.040 --> 04:58.400
I'm Nanno.

04:58.920 --> 05:00.040
I'm a new student here.

05:00.120 --> 05:01.960
Mind if I join the party?

05:08.120 --> 05:10.400
Who sent you? The headmaster?

05:11.640 --> 05:12.520
No.

05:13.040 --> 05:14.680
I came to help you, Pankham.

05:14.760 --> 05:16.760
Oh? You two know each other?

05:16.840 --> 05:18.600
I know the whole team.

05:20.800 --> 05:22.760
Hey, guys, what's going on in there?

05:22.840 --> 05:23.720
Shit.

05:24.840 --> 05:26.120
The Boy Scouts are here.

05:31.840 --> 05:33.920
Shit, do you have anything
you haven't told us?

05:34.000 --> 05:34.840
I don't know her.

05:38.720 --> 05:39.840
What are you doing here?

05:39.920 --> 05:41.920
Where I sit is none of your business.

05:42.000 --> 05:43.720
Do you see this badge?

05:46.560 --> 05:48.760
I received orders directly
from the headmaster

05:49.520 --> 05:52.000
to monitor those who undermine
and sabotage the school.

05:52.600 --> 05:54.080
And I have a feeling

05:54.600 --> 05:58.560
I can smell the rotten
Bangkwai Exclamation group around here.

05:59.520 --> 06:00.520
Can you smell it too?

06:00.600 --> 06:02.200
Other than your bad breath,

06:02.280 --> 06:04.080
I don't smell shit.

06:09.520 --> 06:11.400
‎NO ENTRY

06:15.040 --> 06:15.600
‎Shit.

06:15.680 --> 06:17.280
I think we're busted.

06:39.520 --> 06:40.640
Hey. It's coming
from the front of the school.

06:51.400 --> 06:52.200
Shit.

06:52.720 --> 06:54.320
-Hurry.
-Damn it.

06:54.400 --> 06:57.040
-Slowly.
-Sit there.

06:57.560 --> 06:58.920
Be quiet.

06:59.000 --> 06:59.840
No, no.

06:59.920 --> 07:01.200
-Let go first.
-Alright.

07:02.400 --> 07:03.280
Who's this?

07:03.360 --> 07:06.160
Hi, Tae. I'm Nanno.

07:07.040 --> 07:08.200
Nanno who?

07:09.640 --> 07:11.360
Your gang is amazing.

07:11.440 --> 07:14.560
The Exclamation gang.

07:21.840 --> 07:24.400
You want to expose the corruption
in the building's renovation, right?

07:24.960 --> 07:28.560
I have a plan. I'll help.

07:40.200 --> 07:41.600
BANGKWAI WITTHAYAKHOM

07:41.680 --> 07:43.320
What happened?

07:47.760 --> 07:49.160
-Shit.
-Shit.

07:49.760 --> 07:51.160
Teacher, now the school's name is Bang…

07:51.240 --> 07:53.040
BANGKHUAY WITTHAYAKHOM'S 100-YEAR BUILDING

07:54.200 --> 07:55.960
Students, go to your classrooms!

07:56.040 --> 07:57.960
Now. Go.

07:58.040 --> 07:59.680
You too. Run!

08:01.920 --> 08:04.440
How obscene.

08:08.200 --> 08:10.360
#CORRUPTRENOVATIONWILLKILLUSALL

08:10.440 --> 08:12.040
Instead of fixing their wrongdoings…

08:12.120 --> 08:13.600
IN 24 DAYS, BANGKWAI WITTHAYAKHOM'S
100-YEAR BUILDING WILL OPEN

08:14.400 --> 08:16.920
…evil people choose to cover it up
with something else

08:17.880 --> 08:19.800
to make others obedient

08:20.560 --> 08:22.440
and easier to control.

08:23.000 --> 08:24.280
How cute.

08:24.360 --> 08:27.040
HEADMASTER YAEM THATSARAI

08:27.120 --> 08:28.120
This morning,

08:29.480 --> 08:31.280
what were the students screaming about?

08:31.800 --> 08:32.640
Nothing, Headmaster.

08:32.720 --> 08:35.240
They were just screaming
about a shipped couple they follow.

09:14.880 --> 09:17.000
Mr. Dobby, do you also feel

09:18.520 --> 09:21.520
that these people
are hiding something from us?

09:26.360 --> 09:27.520
Come in.

09:41.240 --> 09:42.520
Well, hello.

09:46.120 --> 09:47.600
The students are shocked by the news

09:47.680 --> 09:49.800
from this secret page, Headmaster.

09:50.720 --> 09:52.000
Look, Mr. Dobby.

09:53.640 --> 09:54.960
Are you scared?

09:55.040 --> 09:57.520
Why don't you go run around for a bit?

09:58.040 --> 09:59.360
Go take a walk.

10:01.240 --> 10:02.440
Thank you.

10:02.960 --> 10:04.080
Thank you very much.

10:06.120 --> 10:09.920
This new student sent me an email

10:10.440 --> 10:12.920
about the Exclamation group.

10:13.000 --> 10:14.680
They're just an underground page.

10:15.760 --> 10:17.880
They make things up
without having any real facts.

10:17.960 --> 10:19.880
But the news is already out.

10:21.240 --> 10:22.880
And the students already believe it.

10:24.040 --> 10:26.720
Deputy Headmasters, perhaps you're too old

10:26.800 --> 10:29.120
to keep up with the students anymore.

10:29.200 --> 10:32.160
Maybe it's time
to let the new student handle it instead.

10:32.240 --> 10:33.560
Just a moment.

10:50.440 --> 10:51.600
Beautiful.

10:51.680 --> 10:52.760
Thank you.

10:52.840 --> 10:56.240
Don't disappoint Mr. Dobby and me.

10:57.520 --> 10:58.520
Yes.

11:11.760 --> 11:13.840
Wait, Nanno.

11:15.240 --> 11:18.720
From now on, don't do that again, okay?

11:20.320 --> 11:21.560
What do you mean?

11:22.080 --> 11:24.000
How do I say this?

11:24.080 --> 11:25.000
Normally,

11:25.080 --> 11:28.160
we teachers are the headmaster's advisors.

11:28.240 --> 11:29.240
HAVING A JOB AND A SALARY ISN'T
AS IMPORTANT AS HAVING GOOD COWORKERS

11:29.320 --> 11:33.320
But suddenly,
you reported directly to the headmaster

11:33.400 --> 11:35.840
-like we are--
-Just useless ornaments?

11:35.920 --> 11:38.240
Yes, ornaments.

11:38.320 --> 11:40.120
Hey, you.

11:40.200 --> 11:41.280
I'll…

11:42.200 --> 11:43.520
-Take her away first.
-You.

11:47.400 --> 11:48.400
Nanno.

11:49.640 --> 11:51.320
I know you're a smart student.

11:51.400 --> 11:53.800
Having you help keep an eye on things

11:53.880 --> 11:55.040
makes me very happy.

11:56.560 --> 11:57.880
But from now on,

11:58.480 --> 12:00.760
if you find anything,
could you tell me first?

12:02.520 --> 12:03.880
Hmm.

12:04.400 --> 12:08.200
So, Deputy Headmaster Kai, you also don't
like students going over your head, right?

12:12.160 --> 12:13.440
I understand.

12:15.400 --> 12:16.840
So now I'm curious.

12:17.440 --> 12:19.720
What will you do about the news
that the Exclamation group released?

12:30.080 --> 12:32.080
DEPUTY KAI, DEPUTY NOO,
DEPUTY NOK, DEPUTY TAO

12:32.160 --> 12:34.600
NANNO

12:34.680 --> 12:37.240
The famous Bangkwai school shipped couple

12:37.320 --> 12:40.360
secretly unfollowed each other.
Is their relationship about to end?

12:41.000 --> 12:42.840
They said a shipped couple
is about to break up.

12:43.360 --> 12:45.400
-Is it the same one?
-Yeah, the same one.

12:45.480 --> 12:46.200
WHY ARE THEY BREAKING UP?

12:46.280 --> 12:47.760
Such a shame about this couple.

12:52.120 --> 12:54.040
BB and Taetae are breaking up?

12:54.120 --> 12:55.400
Are they really breaking up?

12:55.480 --> 12:56.680
They were so cute together.

12:56.760 --> 12:57.640
-THEY'LL MAKE UP SOON
-GIVE IT THREE DAYS

12:57.720 --> 12:59.520
-They really are breaking up.
-What a pity.

13:12.120 --> 13:13.960
Didn't you say you wanted to join us?

13:14.040 --> 13:15.840
I already told you.

13:16.360 --> 13:17.760
I have a plan.

13:18.280 --> 13:19.600
Here it is.

13:20.120 --> 13:22.680
I've become
the headmaster's special advisor.

13:23.840 --> 13:28.040
Has any Exclamation member
ever gotten access like this?

13:33.000 --> 13:35.160
Keep your eyes on the flagpole.

13:49.960 --> 13:51.880
IN 23 DAYS, BANGKWAI WITTHAYAKHOM'S
100-YEAR BUILDING WILL OPEN

14:23.360 --> 14:24.560
Hey.

14:25.160 --> 14:26.640
Students, move aside.

14:26.720 --> 14:28.320
-Move aside.
-Go.

14:30.600 --> 14:32.240
EVEN THE FLAGPOLE DIDN'T SURVIVE

14:32.320 --> 14:35.240
#CORRUPTRENOVATIONWILLKILLUSALL

14:35.320 --> 14:37.280
Corruption was even involved
in the building of the flagpole?

14:37.360 --> 14:40.000
Damn, then how bad
must the 100-Year Building be?

14:40.080 --> 14:41.240
That's scary.

14:41.320 --> 14:44.640
Yeah. Why hasn't anyone
spoken out about it?

14:44.720 --> 14:47.280
They say the headmaster
is the one behind the corruption.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.640
Really?

14:48.720 --> 14:52.280
The Exclamation group is amazing,
exposing the truth for our school.

14:52.360 --> 14:55.080
Yeah. If it weren't for them,
we wouldn't even know.

15:03.320 --> 15:05.720
I bet the headmaster and her deputies
can't sit still right now.

15:05.800 --> 15:06.920
I bet everything will go quiet again soon.

15:07.000 --> 15:10.520
-They're awesome. Who are they anyway?
-Yeah, I want to join them.

15:10.600 --> 15:12.160
Yeah, so we can expose this corruption.

15:12.240 --> 15:14.840
Do you think
the Exclamation group will get taken down?

15:22.560 --> 15:23.640
Come in.

15:33.520 --> 15:35.520
How did the Exclamation group
get this information?

15:37.160 --> 15:40.360
The rigged bidding and locked specs
for the flagpole, right?

15:42.360 --> 15:44.160
The contractor was Ruja Construction,

15:44.760 --> 15:48.200
the same company that handled
the renovation of our 100-Year Building.

15:49.040 --> 15:50.760
What a coincidence.

15:56.480 --> 15:57.640
Not a coincidence.

15:58.160 --> 15:59.120
I approved it myself.

16:00.280 --> 16:02.040
That company does good work.
It's reliable.

16:03.320 --> 16:04.760
We've used them for years.

16:08.200 --> 16:10.280
And it just so happens

16:10.360 --> 16:13.200
that Mrs. Ruja, the company's owner,

16:13.280 --> 16:15.920
is your wife.

16:19.320 --> 16:22.000
Well, the 100-Year Building
is exactly what its name says.

16:22.600 --> 16:24.000
The structure
has been around for a long time.

16:24.600 --> 16:26.920
How could I let
an unfamiliar company handle it?

16:27.000 --> 16:28.800
Of course I had to choose
a company I trust.

16:28.880 --> 16:32.640
Trusting your wife is a good thing.

16:40.400 --> 16:41.840
I won't keep beating around the bush.

16:42.800 --> 16:44.080
I'm the one responsible for this project.

16:44.600 --> 16:46.600
And I've already signed off
on its completion.

16:47.920 --> 16:50.240
-If the building can't open on schedule,
-If the building can't open on schedule,

16:50.320 --> 16:51.760
-I'll be in serious trouble.
-you'll be in serious trouble.

16:51.840 --> 16:53.000
Checkmate.

17:00.760 --> 17:02.160
I understand.

17:05.319 --> 17:09.119
Could you recommend
a feng shui master for me urgently?

17:10.760 --> 17:13.400
BANGKHUAY WITTHAYAKHOM'S 100-YEAR BUILDING

17:13.480 --> 17:16.000
IN 20 DAYS, BANGKWAI WITTHAYAKHOM'S
100-YEAR BUILDING WILL OPEN

17:20.200 --> 17:22.440
NO ENTRY

17:26.640 --> 17:27.960
Hey, guys, check out this live stream.

17:28.040 --> 17:29.920
What live stream?

17:30.720 --> 17:32.280
BANGKWAI WITTHAYAKHOM SCHOOL

17:32.360 --> 17:34.000
Damn.

17:34.960 --> 17:36.240
What the hell is this?

17:36.320 --> 17:38.440
This is the real reason.

17:38.520 --> 17:40.880
Underneath here are inauspicious things.

17:40.960 --> 17:42.640
-Someone did this.
-Look at this.

17:42.720 --> 17:44.480
That means they have ill intentions

17:44.560 --> 17:46.320
and malicious motives.

17:46.840 --> 17:50.520
And this is their symbol.

17:51.840 --> 17:52.880
Shit.

17:52.960 --> 17:54.040
-Shit.
-What the hell?

17:55.760 --> 17:57.160
Hey, that's an exclamation mark.

18:00.320 --> 18:01.920
-Let's leave first. Go.
-Yeah.

18:02.800 --> 18:03.640
‎-Nobel.
‎-No, come on.

18:03.840 --> 18:05.280
Slowly, carefully.

18:05.360 --> 18:06.200
Come on.

18:08.880 --> 18:09.960
Get up.

18:10.040 --> 18:10.880
What's wrong?

18:10.960 --> 18:11.960
Nanno.

18:12.560 --> 18:13.480
Nanno is one of us.

18:13.560 --> 18:16.720
Nanno brought the Boy Scouts this way.
What do you mean one of us?

18:21.000 --> 18:23.000
Hey, we have to run first.

18:23.080 --> 18:24.480
All our group data is in here.

18:24.560 --> 18:25.800
Shit.

18:28.480 --> 18:30.040
Hey, this way, guys.

18:30.640 --> 18:31.640
Hurry up.

18:31.720 --> 18:32.760
Go.

18:38.360 --> 18:41.240
-You guys can go.
-Exclamation group! Open the door.

18:41.720 --> 18:44.240
-I know you're inside.
-We'll handle it.

18:44.760 --> 18:46.040
-Open the door.
-Go, Beng, go.

18:46.640 --> 18:49.760
-Hold on tight.
-If you don't open it, I'll break it down.

18:50.440 --> 18:51.960
-I warned you. Open it.
-Careful.

18:57.720 --> 18:58.680
Break it down.

19:15.160 --> 19:16.280
Students,

19:17.960 --> 19:21.080
these two are members
of the Exclamation group,

19:21.880 --> 19:25.920
the group that spreads false accusations
about our school without any evidence.

19:27.200 --> 19:30.720
Their claim that
the 100-Year Building will collapse

19:30.800 --> 19:32.800
is completely false.

19:34.480 --> 19:37.160
And I'm not speaking without proof.

19:38.160 --> 19:40.840
I have invited someone
with authority on the matter

19:40.920 --> 19:42.640
to speak to all of you.

19:43.360 --> 19:44.600
Please welcome him.

19:45.320 --> 19:46.440
Hello.

19:46.520 --> 19:49.240
I am the engineer
responsible for the 100-Year Building.

19:49.320 --> 19:52.360
I assure all students

19:52.880 --> 19:54.040
that the 100-Year Building

19:54.120 --> 19:57.640
has been renovated properly, according
to all civil engineering standards.

19:58.160 --> 19:59.480
You can rest easy.

20:00.000 --> 20:02.000
All the rumors circulating in this school

20:02.520 --> 20:03.840
are fake news.

20:07.200 --> 20:10.160
So, if you don't believe an engineer,

20:10.240 --> 20:12.040
who will you believe?

20:12.560 --> 20:13.720
Exactly.

20:13.800 --> 20:18.920
Therefore, what these two did
deserves expulsion.

20:19.000 --> 20:20.280
Shit.

20:22.080 --> 20:22.920
Expel them.

20:23.000 --> 20:24.440
-Yeah, expel them.
-Expel?

20:25.480 --> 20:26.480
But…

20:27.000 --> 20:28.880
I'm a kind person.

20:28.960 --> 20:31.320
I can't just expel them like that.

20:31.400 --> 20:34.240
So I'd like to give them one more chance.

20:34.880 --> 20:37.080
Potae, open it.

20:41.840 --> 20:44.560
This is the face of the Exclamation group

20:45.720 --> 20:49.080
that spreads fake news
to destroy our school.

20:49.160 --> 20:51.320
Now you've all seen

20:51.400 --> 20:54.040
how many of them there are, right?

20:55.320 --> 20:56.360
One.

20:57.080 --> 20:58.240
Two.

20:59.360 --> 21:00.240
Three.

21:00.760 --> 21:01.600
Four.

21:01.680 --> 21:03.360
And five.

21:04.520 --> 21:06.120
The other three members

21:06.640 --> 21:08.800
are standing here right now, right?

21:09.320 --> 21:12.800
If either of you can tell me

21:13.320 --> 21:14.840
who the other three are,

21:16.040 --> 21:17.720
I will regard you as witnesses.

21:18.240 --> 21:20.480
That means
you won't receive any punishment.

21:21.560 --> 21:25.200
No, remember our ideals. Don't do it.

21:28.760 --> 21:31.320
You don't need to say their names.

21:31.840 --> 21:33.640
Just point at them.

21:42.280 --> 21:44.000
No, don't do it.

21:44.080 --> 21:45.040
Just point.

21:45.120 --> 21:46.760
-Remember our ideals.
-Come on.

21:50.960 --> 21:52.560
Point.

21:53.320 --> 21:54.200
Tell us.

21:56.960 --> 21:57.800
Hey, No.

22:01.000 --> 22:02.200
Point.

22:09.360 --> 22:10.560
Hey, No!

22:11.080 --> 22:12.120
Don't do it.

22:14.840 --> 22:16.000
Point at them.

22:16.080 --> 22:17.040
Point at them.

22:19.760 --> 22:20.960
Hey?

22:21.040 --> 22:22.120
-Potae?
-Potae?

22:22.200 --> 22:24.520
-Really?
-Really?

22:24.600 --> 22:26.280
-Damn you.
-You? What the hell?

22:29.120 --> 22:31.120
Down with the corrupt!

22:31.200 --> 22:33.040
Long live Exclamation!

22:33.640 --> 22:35.000
Do it for me.

22:35.080 --> 22:36.640
Destroy them.

22:36.720 --> 22:38.040
Ugh!

22:38.560 --> 22:41.680
These two are hereby expelled
from Bangkwai School immediately.

22:41.760 --> 22:42.760
Take them away.

22:42.840 --> 22:44.840
Get out. Get out.

22:44.920 --> 22:46.640
-Get out.
-Damn, No. I love you.

22:47.400 --> 22:49.720
Get out. Get out.

22:53.680 --> 22:54.560
Get out.

22:54.640 --> 22:56.560
IN 20 DAYS

22:56.640 --> 22:58.560
IN 19 DAYS

23:02.320 --> 23:06.480
NO ENTRY

23:20.160 --> 23:21.480
5:30 P.M. - THIRD FLOOR COMPUTER ROOM

23:21.560 --> 23:22.440
What do we do now?

23:24.000 --> 23:25.720
We have to do it for Nobel and Tae.

23:25.800 --> 23:29.400
We have to stop
the 100-Year Building from opening.

23:30.120 --> 23:32.360
But our futures matter too.

23:32.440 --> 23:34.120
If I get expelled now,

23:34.640 --> 23:35.920
my dad will kill me.

23:36.000 --> 23:39.600
But if the 100-Year Building collapses,
we'll be dead too.

23:40.240 --> 23:41.240
And in that case…

23:41.880 --> 23:42.960
we'd be dead for real.

23:46.120 --> 23:48.960
The engineer already confirmed

23:49.040 --> 23:51.280
that the building won't collapse.

23:51.360 --> 23:53.360
You actually believe that headmaster?

23:54.760 --> 23:57.200
You saw the condition yourself.
Did you forget already?

23:57.280 --> 23:59.080
But we're not engineers.

23:59.880 --> 24:02.040
Even if it really collapsed,

24:02.120 --> 24:03.840
no one would care anyway.

24:05.480 --> 24:08.960
Why should we gamble our futures for this?

24:12.000 --> 24:13.280
It's okay, Beng.

24:15.080 --> 24:17.720
If you're not comfortable with this
or if you want to quit…

24:20.720 --> 24:21.800
I understand.

24:31.360 --> 24:38.040
BANGKWAI WITTHAYAKHOM'S 100-YEAR BUILDING

24:43.920 --> 24:46.240
Even if it really did collapse,

24:46.320 --> 24:48.320
no one would care anyway.

24:50.920 --> 24:55.160
NO ENTRY

25:04.320 --> 25:07.360
5:30 P.M. - THIRD FLOOR COMPUTER ROOM

25:10.800 --> 25:13.040
5:39 P.M.

25:28.800 --> 25:32.160
Sorry. I ran into some Scouts,
so I had to take a detour.

25:34.680 --> 25:35.880
I thought you weren't coming.

25:38.120 --> 25:39.080
Shall we start?

25:39.600 --> 25:40.640
Sure.

25:45.960 --> 25:47.000
What was that sound?

26:09.360 --> 26:11.040
Ugh, not her again.

26:11.120 --> 26:12.720
Did you bring Nanno here too?

26:14.160 --> 26:16.640
I didn't bring her. I came alone.

26:16.720 --> 26:19.640
You're telling me
you came in and didn't see her?

26:20.160 --> 26:21.200
Listen to me first, Wanda.

26:21.280 --> 26:23.160
Pankham, I can't stand you anymore.

26:23.240 --> 26:25.320
I can't believe you brought Nanno here.

26:27.600 --> 26:29.680
Nanno, how long have you been there?

26:30.640 --> 26:31.880
And how did you know we were meeting here?

26:31.960 --> 26:33.880
What's wrong with you, Pankham?

26:35.000 --> 26:36.520
You're still talking to her?

26:37.160 --> 26:39.720
She already got
two of our friends expelled.

26:41.400 --> 26:42.600
Wait, Wanda.

26:42.680 --> 26:44.720
I have something to show you.

26:55.120 --> 26:56.280
How did you get this?

26:57.960 --> 26:59.680
I was hiding in that room.

27:00.200 --> 27:02.200
Just like I was hiding in this one.

27:03.000 --> 27:06.680
You didn't even know I was here.

27:10.560 --> 27:11.920
I'll send it to you.

27:18.600 --> 27:21.200
If the Exclamation group
releases this clip,

27:21.800 --> 27:23.840
they're finished.

27:37.480 --> 27:40.000
The engineer who spoke earlier was fake.

27:40.080 --> 27:42.880
It was actually Potae
from the Scout group,

27:43.880 --> 27:45.440
deepfaking someone's face.

27:46.080 --> 27:48.240
-And the person behind it is…
-I am the engineer.

27:48.320 --> 27:49.880
I assure all students…

27:50.880 --> 27:53.120
If they keep insisting
on opening the building,

27:53.720 --> 27:54.720
it will collapse for sure.

27:54.800 --> 27:56.560
#CORRUPTRENOVATIONWILLKILLUSALL

27:56.640 --> 27:58.640
IN 17 DAYS

27:58.720 --> 28:00.560
Guys, come look at this.

28:00.640 --> 28:02.480
The engineer was fake.

28:04.600 --> 28:05.520
I told you.

28:07.960 --> 28:09.320
Shit.

28:17.080 --> 28:18.920
Deputy Kai is corrupt.

28:19.000 --> 28:20.480
They even used AI to fake an engineer?

28:20.560 --> 28:22.880
-Then the headmaster is corrupt too?
-One hundred percent.

28:29.480 --> 28:32.400
IN 16 DAYS

28:32.480 --> 28:34.360
That Exclamation group
still hasn't given up.

28:34.960 --> 28:36.880
Our students aren't even
paying attention to this anymore.

28:36.960 --> 28:38.440
But the pillar is right there.

28:51.200 --> 28:52.680
And the repair budget is already used up.

28:52.760 --> 28:54.360
I don't want the headmaster to find out.

28:58.000 --> 29:00.080
Maybe the sacred spirits can help.

29:02.680 --> 29:06.720
HAVING A JOB AND A SALARY ISN'T
AS IMPORTANT AS HAVING GOOD COWORKERS

29:07.640 --> 29:10.840
Taetae and BB broke up
because of a third person.

29:10.920 --> 29:11.880
Hey, who is it?

29:11.960 --> 29:13.720
Did someone really cause them to breakup?

29:18.400 --> 29:22.440
BB blocked Taetae. Or maybe someone
used black magic on them.

29:22.520 --> 29:23.360
Do they really have to do this?

29:23.440 --> 29:25.960
How can we help them?

29:29.960 --> 29:34.480
The Sacred 100-Year Pillar
grants every wish.

29:36.680 --> 29:40.640
Twisting the truth and diverting attention

29:42.240 --> 29:45.760
are the art of those who control the game.

29:51.080 --> 29:52.160
What are you doing?

29:52.240 --> 29:55.320
The school said this pillar is sacred.
Don't you know?

29:55.400 --> 29:56.800
Everyone in this school knows that.

30:02.040 --> 30:04.720
Nanno, whose side are you actually on?

30:10.160 --> 30:13.640
IN 5 DAYS

30:34.680 --> 30:35.680
Take it.

30:45.960 --> 30:47.560
Maybe this is all we can do.

30:53.640 --> 30:55.000
Honestly, I've been thinking.

30:55.520 --> 30:57.280
What are we even doing all this for?

30:57.360 --> 30:59.280
No one cares.

31:02.200 --> 31:04.960
But I want us to be wrong now.

31:07.200 --> 31:09.640
Maybe that building
is actually strong enough.

31:11.200 --> 31:13.240
Maybe we're just being paranoid.

31:18.160 --> 31:21.520
IN 1 DAY

31:30.520 --> 31:33.480
Today is a special day as we finally
reopen our 100-Year school building

31:33.560 --> 31:35.520
after a long renovation.

31:36.200 --> 31:38.520
The headmaster will now cut the ribbon
to officially open the building.

31:39.120 --> 31:41.960
Students, please follow the arranged lines

31:42.040 --> 31:43.600
and walk into the building in order.

31:43.680 --> 31:46.000
Your homeroom teachers will lead the way.

31:46.080 --> 31:47.640
Headmaster, please cut the ribbon.

31:47.720 --> 31:49.200
Ready?

32:04.200 --> 32:06.320
-Headmaster, this way, please.
-Alright.

32:06.400 --> 32:07.640
Mr. Dobby, let's go.

32:09.360 --> 32:11.040
All the materials used were brand new.

32:11.120 --> 32:14.000
Students, please line up
before entering the building.

32:14.080 --> 32:16.360
There are signs inside.

32:16.440 --> 32:18.080
Go directly to your classrooms.

32:18.160 --> 32:19.600
First row, you may proceed.

32:40.480 --> 32:42.560
What are we even doing all this for?

32:43.160 --> 32:44.720
No one cares.

32:46.040 --> 32:47.920
Even if it really did collapse,

32:48.000 --> 32:49.840
no one would care anyway.

32:53.400 --> 32:56.320
The famous couple has broken up.

32:58.120 --> 32:59.560
Twisting the truth

33:00.240 --> 33:02.080
and diverting attention

33:02.600 --> 33:05.960
are the art of those who control the game.

33:10.720 --> 33:12.600
Now, Pankham.

33:30.880 --> 33:32.280
BB, come with me.

33:32.360 --> 33:33.320
-What?
-Hurry.

33:39.120 --> 33:41.040
Are you excited? Hmm?

33:43.240 --> 33:44.080
Alright.

33:44.160 --> 33:45.920
I was thinking of putting
a photo here, Headmaster.

33:46.000 --> 33:48.040
Oh, what photo?

33:48.120 --> 33:50.040
Let's discuss it in your new office.

33:50.760 --> 33:52.160
-Sure.
-Please go upstairs.

33:52.680 --> 33:54.920
The photo would lead people
to your office.

33:55.000 --> 33:55.920
Oh, alright.

33:57.560 --> 33:58.760
BB, hurry.

33:59.280 --> 34:00.600
What the hell?

34:03.280 --> 34:04.840
Why did you block Taetae?

34:04.920 --> 34:06.360
And why did you delete
the photos from Instagram?

34:06.440 --> 34:07.600
It's none of your business.

34:11.600 --> 34:13.280
Your office is on the top floor.

34:13.360 --> 34:15.000
The view from up there is great.

34:16.440 --> 34:18.639
What did Taetae do to make you angry?
Tell me.

34:18.719 --> 34:21.480
Oh, did Taetae send you?

34:21.560 --> 34:22.800
Hey, answer my question.

34:22.880 --> 34:23.920
What did he do to make you mad?

34:24.000 --> 34:25.040
-Just say it.
-Are you crazy?

34:25.120 --> 34:26.600
Hey! What are you doing?

34:34.639 --> 34:35.639
BB.

34:36.159 --> 34:37.280
I'm sorry.

34:37.840 --> 34:40.320
Can we get back together?

34:43.320 --> 34:44.199
Hey.

34:44.280 --> 34:46.239
BB and Taetae.

34:46.320 --> 34:47.159
Let's go.

34:52.400 --> 34:53.679
It's so beautiful.

34:59.320 --> 35:00.520
Why do I feel dizzy?

35:00.600 --> 35:02.800
Maybe it's because the pressure
in my ears is uneven.

35:21.120 --> 35:22.560
Don't do this.

35:23.080 --> 35:24.440
The whole school is watching us.

35:54.000 --> 35:55.000
Mr. Dobby.

36:19.720 --> 36:21.240
Deputy Kai,

36:21.320 --> 36:23.800
is this building really safe?

36:25.840 --> 36:27.000
Yes, it is.

36:46.520 --> 36:48.680
Everyone, go! Hurry!

36:49.200 --> 36:51.440
Everyone, run! Hurry!

36:51.520 --> 36:52.440
Run!

36:52.520 --> 36:55.720
Everyone, run! Move.

37:19.040 --> 37:20.040
Here.

37:30.320 --> 37:31.640
The 100-Year Building…

37:39.040 --> 37:43.520
It has now become a monument
to the Exclamation group.

37:58.760 --> 38:01.000
Have you thanked me yet?

38:01.640 --> 38:04.200
I should thank you too, Pankham,

38:04.280 --> 38:06.080
for your cooperation.

39:06.640 --> 39:08.480
WHAT ARE YOU DOING, NANNO?
THE SKY IS NICE TODAY.

39:08.560 --> 39:10.280
HELLO, SKY. THE SKY IS NICE TODAY.

39:36.720 --> 39:38.120
Because the school's interests

39:38.200 --> 39:40.480
must be the same
as the students' interests.

39:41.080 --> 39:42.320
Hello.

39:42.400 --> 39:43.840
I'm Nanno. My number is two.

39:43.920 --> 39:47.760
My policy is "One Idea, One Kiss."

39:48.880 --> 39:51.040
-Nanno. Nanno.
-We found evidence of fraud

39:51.120 --> 39:53.480
in the student council election.

39:53.560 --> 39:56.640
Humans tend to repeat the same mistakes
over and over again.

39:56.720 --> 39:58.680
What makes you think
you're better than everyone else?

39:59.560 --> 40:01.600
CONGRATULATIONS, MR. PARADON TANGNAITHAM,
66TH STUDENT COUNCIL PRESIDENT

41:57.840 --> 42:01.840
Subtitle translation by: Panuwat Baikeawon
